<%- include('partials/head', { publicBg: true, _url: '/tester-guide', pageTitle: "Testers' guide: Saturday 21 November", pageDescription: 'How to get ready for The Great War tester session, what we want tested, and how to tell us what you find.' }) %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<style>
.tg-wrap { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; padding-bottom: 80px; }
.tg-draft { margin: 0 0 18px; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.35); background: rgba(251,191,36,.08); color: #f4e3b5; font: 700 14px 'Baloo 2', sans-serif; }
.tg-box { background: rgba(10,12,18,.72); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 15px 18px; margin: 0 0 12px; }
.tg-box h2 { font: 800 17px 'Baloo 2', sans-serif; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 8px; }
.tg-box p, .tg-box li { font: 600 14.5px/1.6 'Baloo 2', sans-serif; color: #c4c8d2; }
.tg-box p { margin: 0 0 8px; }
.tg-box ol, .tg-box ul { margin: 0 0 6px; padding-left: 20px; }
.tg-box li { margin: 0 0 5px; }
.tg-box a { color: #8fb8ff; }
.tg-box code { background: rgba(255,255,255,.08); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 5px; color: #e8e9ee; }
</style>
<main class="wrap"><div class="tg-wrap">
  <%- include('partials/home-link') %>
  <div class="page-head"><div><h1 class="page-title">Testers' guide</h1><p class="page-sub">Saturday 21 November · 19:00 UK time · a 30-minute battle · thank you for helping</p></div></div>
  <% if (!isPublic) { %><div class="tg-draft">Hidden: only the owner sees this page until it's made public (site setting testers_guide_public). Check the "not in yet" list against the build before publishing.</div><% } %>
  <% if (locals.isOwner) { %><form method="POST" action="/tester-guide/public" style="margin:0 0 18px"><input type="hidden" name="public" value="<%= isPublic ? 'off' : 'on' %>"><button type="submit" style="padding:9px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:0;background:<%= isPublic ? 'rgba(255,255,255,.12)' : '#5be38f' %>;color:<%= isPublic ? '#fff' : '#0c1a12' %>;font:800 14px 'Baloo 2',sans-serif;cursor:pointer"><%= isPublic ? 'Hide again (owner only)' : 'Make this page public' %></button></form><% } %>

  <div class="tg-box"><h2>Before the day</h2><ol>
    <li>Download the modpack from <a href="/pack">the pack page</a>. It must say <b>v0.26.8</b>.</li>
    <li>Install it as a <b>new instance</b> (the <a href="/first-hour">first-hour guide</a> shows how). Don't update an old one in place.</li>
    <li>Launch it once and join the official server before 19:00, so anything that goes wrong turns up before the battle, not during it.</li>
  </ol><p>Older packs (v0.26.5 and before) <b>can no longer join</b> the official server, so please update. Your key bindings may reset to the pack's defaults on the first launch of v0.26.3; if you had changed any, check them in Options, Controls. From v0.26.3 on, the pack keeps your settings (video, sound, controls, keys, servers) and brings them to each new version by itself.</p></div>

  <div class="tg-box"><h2>Tonight: France against Germany</h2>
    <p>It starts at <b>19:00 UK time</b> (GMT) and is <b>one 30-minute battle</b>. Be in the game a few minutes early if you can.</p><ul>
    <li><b>The field:</b> Lorraine, Lower Alsace and Upper Alsace (German) against Nancy and Verdun (French). A red wall marks the edge of the battlefield.</li>
    <li><b>Your side</b> is fixed the first time you join, and you stay on it.</li>
    <li><b>Pick your class</b> when the battle starts: each shows its gun, kit and armour; two of each class per side.</li>
    <li><b>Press P</b> for the battle screen: the score, your side's objectives, and changing class (it applies from your next respawn).</li>
    <li><b>Capture the objectives</b> shown in the bars at the top of the screen, with the tickets and the clock.</li>
    <li><b>When you fall</b> you drop nothing: choose which of your side's regions to come back in, and your class's kit is restored.</li>
    <li><b>Chat works</b>, including for accounts whose chat is limited by their Minecraft settings.</li>
  </ul></div>

  <div class="tg-box"><h2>Before you start</h2><ul>
    <li>If you played an older pack, check your video settings: <b>VSync off</b> runs smoother.</li>
    <li>Optional: press the <b>Discord</b> button on the title screen to link your game and keep your settings online.</li>
  </ul></div>

  <div class="tg-box"><h2>Tell us what you find</h2><ul>
    <li><code>/bug</code> followed by what happened, in game, the moment it happens (it records where you are).</li>
    <li><code>/balance</code> followed by what feels too strong or too weak.</li>
    <li>Anything else, or after the battle: <a href="/report">the report form</a>.</li>
  </ul><p>"I didn't understand what to do" is a useful report too.</p></div>
</div></main>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
